---
description: Attach observed and uncertain conditions to exact plots before proposing consequential work.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; change: GardenChange }
returns: PlotConditionMap[]
---
Use new assessments only when they identify a plot, date, method, and responsible source. Retain prior observations as historical, not current facts. Identify any intervention requiring local agronomic or safety expertise. If a plot property is untested, keep it uncertain and prohibit plans that rely on it.
